copypastebin (1.2.1-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Release the tested 1.2.1 maintenance update from 1.2.1-1~test2.
  * Prevent an at sign from bypassing the clipboard-history secret heuristic
    unless the complete text is a valid email address.
  * Apply the history heuristic after removing exactly one trailing LF or
    CRLF without modifying clipboard content.
  * Add regression tests and a synthetic history-policy corpus.
  * Require confirmation before disabling non-empty session history and
    removing its in-memory text entries.

